  "releaseNotes": "TCMProject.Utilities: completes the Platform_* catalogue with emails and storage (44-47) plus the PLATFORM_EMAILS and PLATFORM_STORAGE modules, so every screen the TCM Admin panel already has can be gated. 26.8.25.1 covered tenants, billing and payments but predated the emails, SMTP-servers and storage modules; leaving those unmapped would have forced either an unprotected screen or reusing an unrelated permission. Appended at the end per the enum architecture rule. Non-breaking, additive.",
